       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. TSUBCRWS.
       AUTHOR.     C HILLES.
       DATE-WRITTEN. 12/26/90.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
      *SECURITY.
      *REMARKS.
      *    THIS JUST CALLS EITHER 'TSUBCRWS' OR 'SIRMULT' DEPENDING
      *    ON HOW THE MPLT-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW SWITCH IS SET.  THIS IS
      *    FOR UNMANNED STOREROOMS (NAPANEE) WHERE YOU WANT TO ISSUE
      *    THE MATERIAL IMMEDIATELY RATHER THAN CREATE A WORKSHEET.
      *
      *C   03/07/94   JEFF BUNGO
      *C     ADDED CALL TO TSPLPRT TO RETRIEVE THE USER NAME TO
      *C     PASS TO SIRMULT.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-PK-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.


       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FD AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  MPLTINFO-PK-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500  OF MCFLCS0501.

      *------ FD AREA FOR IBM ONLY ------*

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       77  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG            PIC X(1)  VALUE "Y".
       COPY TSHWRDFM IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TBLOWUP  IN COPYLIB.

       01  STORES-COMAREA.
           05  SCOM-PGM-KEY              PIC X(3) VALUE "SW6".
           05  SAVE-PRT-OPT              PIC X(1).
           05  EDIT-EXP-FLAG             PIC X(1).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(19).

       01  MULTIPLE-STR-DATA             PIC X(45) VALUE SPACES.

           COPY TSPLPRT IN COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **            D A T A B A S E   W O R K                     **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1             PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2             PIC X  VALUE "0".

       01  DB-DATASETS.
           05  DSET-MPLTINFO             PIC X(16)  VALUE "MPLTINFO;".

       01  MODE-AREA.
           05  MODE1                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 1.
           05  MODE3                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 3.
           05  MODE5                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 5.
           05  MODE7                  PIC S9(4)   COMP       VALUE 7.

       01  PLT-ARG                       PIC X(4)  VALUE "P 01".
      **************************************************************
      **                                                          **
      **           D A T A B A S E   B U F F E R S                **
      **                                                          **
      **************************************************************
       COPY MPLT0      IN COPYLIB.
       COPY MPLTST     IN COPYLIB.

      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *          L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N                     *
      *                                                            *
      **************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.
       01  ISCR-RET-CODE                 PIC S9(4) COMP-4.
       01  BASE                          PIC X(24).
       01  BASE-MMISA                    PIC X(24).
       COPY DBSTAT     IN COPYLIB.
       COPY VCOMLINK   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY LANGSUB    IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TISSCRWS   IN COPYLIB.
       01  PASSED-MPLTINFO-COMP          PIC X(4).
       01  ESC-NAME.
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(452).
           05  SAVE-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW     PIC X(4).
           05  FILLER                    PIC X(24).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING ISCR-RET-CODE, BASE, BASE-MMISA,
           STATUS-AREA, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS, ISCR-DATA,
           PASSED-MPLTINFO-COMP, ESC-NAME.
       1-BEGIN.
      *------ I CHEAT AND SAVE THE MULTI/REMOTE FLAG IN AN
      *------ ESC-NAME VARIABLE THAT IS NOT USED...
           IF SAVE-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW = "YES."
               CALL "SIRMULT" USING BASE, BASE-MMISA, STATUS-AREA,
                 VIEW-COMAREA, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
                 SRF-SPOOLER-REC, LANGUAGE-PARMS, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA,
                 ESC-NAME, ISCR-DATA
           ELSE
           IF SAVE-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW = "NO. "
               CALL "SSUBCRWS" USING ISCR-RET-CODE, BASE, BASE-MMISA,
                 STATUS-AREA, VIEW-COMAREA, LANGUAGE-PARMS,
                 ISCR-DATA, PASSED-MPLTINFO-COMP, ESC-NAME
           ELSE
               PERFORM 9999-OPEN-STUFF
               MOVE "STST" TO PLT-ARG
               PERFORM 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I
               PERFORM 9999-CLOSE-STUFF
               CALL "TSPLPRT" USING SP-RET-CODE SP-AREA
               MOVE SP-USERNAME TO SRF-USERNAME
               IF MPLT-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW = "Y"
                   MOVE "YES." TO SAVE-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW
                   CALL "SIRMULT" USING BASE, BASE-MMISA, STATUS-AREA,
                    VIEW-COMAREA, STORES-COMAREA, SRF-COMAREA,
                    SRF-SPOOLER-REC, LANGUAGE-PARMS, MULTIPLE-STR-DATA,
                    ESC-NAME, ISCR-DATA
               ELSE
                   MOVE "NO. " TO SAVE-MULTI-INSTEAD-RW
                   CALL "SSUBCRWS" USING ISCR-RET-CODE, BASE,
                     BASE-MMISA, STATUS-AREA, VIEW-COMAREA,
                     LANGUAGE-PARMS, ISCR-DATA, PASSED-MPLTINFO-COMP,
                     ESC-NAME.
           GOBACK.

       2100-BLOWUP.
061200     MOVE "TSUBCRWS"               TO   BU-PGM-NAME.
061900     CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE BU-PGM-NAME STATUS-AREA
062000       VIEW-COMAREA FILE-STATUS BU-DISPLAY-MSG
062100       BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I.
           MOVE 0 TO COND-WORD.
           MOVE PLT-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-PK-REC-I.
           READ MPLTINFO-PK-I INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "23"
               MOVE 17 TO COND-WORD
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
               MOVE 99 TO COND-WORD
               IF HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y"
                   MOVE "GETKEY ERR 9999-GETKEY-MPLTINFO-PK-I"
                       TO BU-MSG-AREA
                   PERFORM 2100-BLOWUP.

       9999-OPEN-STUFF.
           OPEN INPUT MPLTINFO-PK-I.
       9999-CLOSE-STUFF.
           CLOSE MPLTINFO-PK-I.
